<title>USA: American top cargo carrier at JFK in 1996.</title>
<headline>American top cargo carrier at JFK in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The top air cargo carriers at John F. Kennedy Airport in 1996 were American Airlines with 137,257 tonnes, Deutsche Lufthansa with 95,050 and Korean Air with 72,213 tonnes, the Port Authority of New York and New Jersey said.</p>
<p>It said similar data relating to 1995 was not available. The top 10 cargo carriers were at JFK in 1996 were as follows:</p>
<p>   American Airlines......137,257 tonnes</p>
<p>   Deutsche Lufthansa......95,050</p>
<p>   Korean Air..............72,213</p>
<p>   United..................59,883</p>
<p>   Asiana..................57,998</p>
<p>   Polar Air Cargo.........57,483</p>
<p>   FedEx...................57,070</p>
<p>   DHL Airways.............55,887</p>
<p>   TWA		    .....53,843</p>
<p>   British Airways.........47,540</p>
